<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Billing Information.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Billing Information.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co said its analyst Wayne Johnson started coverage today on Billing Information Concepts Corp with a long-term attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- Billing Information Concepts provides third party billing services to long distance resellers.</p>
<p>-- In a statement, Johnson said he expects the company to grow earnings internally in excess of 20 percent beginning in fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- Johnson has a 12-month price target of $37, or 24-times his fiscal 1998 estimate of $1.54/shr.</p>
<p>-- Billing Information was up 1-3/4 at 27-1/2.</p>
</text>
